# HELP
msgid "product.help.title"
msgstr "Help - Taskwolf"
msgid "product.help.headline"
msgstr "Frequently asked questions"
msgid "product.help.question.support.question"
msgstr "Where and how can I get support?"
msgid "product.help.question.support.answer"
msgstr "If you have any questions, you can contact our email support@taskwolf.net at any time. We also offer a ticket system where you can ask questions and report bugs. You can find this at https://taskwolf.net/tickets/. Our staff will take care of every request as quickly as possible."
msgid "product.help.question.organization.question"
msgstr "What exactly is an organization?"
msgid "product.help.question.organization.answer"
msgstr "An organization is a group of people who operate automation together with the help of Taskwolf. Each organization has its own workflows, processes, databases and devices."
msgid "product.help.question.webhook.question"
msgstr "How does a webhook work?"
msgid "product.help.question.webhook.answer"
msgstr "A webhook can be used, for example, to trigger a workflow through an external request. To do this, a service sends an HTTP request to our system, which triggers the workflow. A detailed documentation will follow soon."
msgid "product.help.question.delete.question"
msgstr "Can I delete my Taskwolf account?"
msgid "product.help.question.delete.answer"
msgstr "To delete your Taskwolf account, click on the banner at the top right, then select \"Settings\" and go to \"Account\". There you will find the option to delete your account."

